- action(n1, "start the process"): Hallucinated action; the phrase "At the start" indicates the beginning of the process (captured by `init(i1)`), not a distinct activity to be performed.
- action(n3, "end the process"): Hallucinated action; the phrase "the process comes to an end" refers to the termination of the process (captured by `end(e1)`), not a distinct activity to be performed.